                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "63c544d9-d11f-4284-a6da-efbff05dfa1d",
                        "source_entry_id": "d3c281e7-24a8-3e5b-b8dc-344b6fa90c12",
                        "source_sense_id": "6da708e6-5603-3f17-8ffe-3a0e500136d8",
                        "source_sense_description": "zusätzliches Arbeitsentgelt zu besonderen Anlässen, zum Beispiel zu Weihnachten",
                        "target_lang_word": "bonus payment",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "378fe11f-0544-47ff-9a8f-b5764875c718",
                        "source_entry_id": "d3c281e7-24a8-3e5b-b8dc-344b6fa90c12",
                        "source_sense_id": "6da708e6-5603-3f17-8ffe-3a0e500136d8",
                        "source_sense_description": "zusätzliches Arbeitsentgelt zu besonderen Anlässen, zum Beispiel zu Weihnachten",
                        "target_lang_word": "gratification",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "gratification",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a408e854-7987-312c-8df6-a67f15437460",
                                        "entry_id": "dfd24814-b0db-3ca0-92fc-f3c5ae983de1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of gratifying or pleasing, either the mind, or the appetite or taste."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd541293-6697-4e51-b539-b5965ac47863",
                                                "sense_id": "a408e854-7987-312c-8df6-a67f15437460",
                                                "text": "gratification of the heart    gratification of the palate"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "76981d35-03ea-4729-abd0-e57b8202d35f",
                                                "sense_id": "a408e854-7987-312c-8df6-a67f15437460",
                                                "text": "I know nothing of Mr. Courtenaye; but I can perceive enough of this affair to see that he is one of those who, for a moment's selfish gratification, or for the yet meaner love of gratified vanity, will excite the deepest feelings, and trifle with the dearest hopes of all who trust them!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fff6b91f-39a1-4a45-a42e-782aae67bc80",
                                                "sense_id": "a408e854-7987-312c-8df6-a67f15437460",
                                                "text": "Many of the so-called rites of these secret societies were so patently ridiculous, that it is quite obvious that they were merely an excuse for men and women to indulge in sex-play and lustful gratification, frequently of an abnormal kind."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e421cef3-343b-3a3e-b4b7-e7d6f113f27a",
                                        "entry_id": "dfd24814-b0db-3ca0-92fc-f3c5ae983de1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A gratuity; a reward."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5dd31f28-2cd8-3d06-a65d-8f59b81fac14",
                                        "entry_id": "dfd24814-b0db-3ca0-92fc-f3c5ae983de1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A feeling of pleasure; satisfaction."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "41044801-3081-418f-9c2c-569c158728f2",
                                                "sense_id": "5dd31f28-2cd8-3d06-a65d-8f59b81fac14",
                                                "text": "I will tell you all my faults frankly beforehand. I am very vain, for I cultivate my vanity on a principle, and cannot understand why we should neglect such a source of gratification."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "178e7ad9-5ea7-48e7-a8b0-855f3c8f720a",
                                                "sense_id": "5dd31f28-2cd8-3d06-a65d-8f59b81fac14",
                                                "text": "To my gratification he told me I could reënter the institution, and that he would trust me to pay the debt when I could."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "61737d92-97c9-4625-9c43-92cd4a959901",
                        "source_entry_id": "d3c281e7-24a8-3e5b-b8dc-344b6fa90c12",
                        "source_sense_id": "6da708e6-5603-3f17-8ffe-3a0e500136d8",
                        "source_sense_description": "zusätzliches Arbeitsentgelt zu besonderen Anlässen, zum Beispiel zu Weihnachten",
                        "target_lang_word": "gratification",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "gratification",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2317e7f0-1d4f-3a83-8a11-1241be687aca",
                                        "entry_id": "6e50ae60-bb20-305b-a547-595a5ec8c276",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Don, libéralité qu’on fait à quelqu’un ; récompense surérogatoire."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cb4e065c-4adc-470b-a071-9e89eb581873",
                                                "sense_id": "2317e7f0-1d4f-3a83-8a11-1241be687aca",
                                                "text": "Telles furent les paroles que l’escorte proféra ; car tous attendaient pareilles gratifications aux dépens des serviteurs et des favoris du roi Richard, si toutefois ils ne les avaient pas déjà reçues, […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c3a68bfe-e915-4a0b-adc4-6869f0d3e952",
                                                "sense_id": "2317e7f0-1d4f-3a83-8a11-1241be687aca",
                                                "text": "Le vice-chancelier Maupeou manda Mme Calas et ses compagnons d'infortune; il leur annonça lui-même les dons du roi. […]. On leur avait dit que si le roi leur accordait une gratification, c’était pour éviter qu’ils prissent à partie le Parlement qui les avait jetés dans l’indigence en même temps que dans le deuil : […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f26469c7-85b8-4ead-9c18-c0ddbfad2767",
                                                "sense_id": "2317e7f0-1d4f-3a83-8a11-1241be687aca",
                                                "text": "L’huis réservé s'ouvrit et le cerbère chargé de le garder sourit à Pibrac qui ne lui ménageait pas les gratifications […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "239e54aa-9759-467c-8596-5e7322dc9709",
                                                "sense_id": "2317e7f0-1d4f-3a83-8a11-1241be687aca",
                                                "text": "Ils demandent ensuite cent francs chacun de gratification quand ils auront trouvé le pêcheur pour nous conduire à l'Oyapok."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
